  "description": "When a man who looks straight out of a fantasy novel stumbles into her home, chef Yujeong sends him packing—but not before feeding him. After all, he was hungry, and a chef should never ignore a guy in need of grub. But the man comes back day after day, with one request for Yujeong: “Help me save my world!” Fateful words that send this humble chef on an adventure for the ages!\nSource: Tapas",
